WEBVTT

00:00:00.666 --> 00:00:01.534
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.296 --> 00:00:04.264
<v><b>A:</b></v> I catch the bus to work.

00:00:08.588 --> 00:00:09.854
<v><b>B:</b></v> So do I.

00:00:11.672 --> 00:00:12.534
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:13.288 --> 00:00:14.878
<v><b>A:</b></v> I like chocolate.

00:00:19.465 --> 00:00:20.452
<v><b>B:</b></v> So do I.

00:00:22.523 --> 00:00:23.354
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:24.195 --> 00:00:25.140
<v><b>A:</b></v> I’m happy.

00:00:29.211 --> 00:00:30.212
<v><b>B:</b></v> So am I.

00:00:32.402 --> 00:00:33.260
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.349
<v><b>A:</b></v> I’m not angry.

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:40.919
<v><b>B:</b></v> Neither am I.

00:00:43.395 --> 00:00:44.304
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:45.152 --> 00:00:46.608
<v><b>A:</b></v> I don’t like football.

00:00:51.005 --> 00:00:52.263
<v><b>B:</b></v> Neither do I.

00:00:54.366 --> 00:00:55.355
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:56.204 --> 00:00:57.675
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m going out tonight.

00:01:01.857 --> 00:01:02.674
<v><b>A:</b></v> So am I.

00:01:04.523 --> 00:01:05.431
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:01:06.193 --> 00:01:07.694
<v><b>A:</b></v> I have a big family.

00:01:12.313 --> 00:01:13.455
<v><b>B:</b></v> So do I.

00:01:15.216 --> 00:01:16.108
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:16.917 --> 00:01:18.142
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m not English.

00:01:22.316 --> 00:01:23.450
<v><b>A:</b></v> Neither am I.

00:01:25.767 --> 00:01:26.715
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:27.389 --> 00:01:28.890
<v><b>A:</b></v> I live in a flat.

00:01:33.517 --> 00:01:34.571
<v><b>B:</b></v> So do I.